  "description": "<ol>\n\t<li>Fire up fedora on top of a fedora generated ocfl <br/>\nYou can use: `./fcrepo-http-api/src/test/resources/ocfl-root`</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>```<br/>\njava -Dfcrepo.ocfl.staging.dir=target/fcrepo-data/staging -Dfcrepo.ocfl.storage.root.dir=fcrepo-http-api/src/test/resources/ocfl-root-Dfcrepo.ocfl.work.dir=target/fcrepo-data/work -jar fcrepo-webapp/target/fcrepo-webapp-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console.jar --headless<br/>\n``` </p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Verify that rebuild succeeded : <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest</a></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Stop Fedora</li>\n\t<li>Start Fedora</li>\n\t<li>Verify that the containment relationships are gone.</li>\n</ol>\n",
